== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: enqcmd [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP4, OPC: 0xF8]
     LENGTH:  6
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: APX
    ISA-SET: APX_F_ENQCMD
    ISA-EXT: APXEVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: APX_EVEX_ENQCMD
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX CPUFLAG_ACCESS ACCEPTS_SEGMENT HAS_EEVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 EC 7F 08 F8 13 

