    ACTIONS: [CF  : 0  ] [PF  : 0  ] [AF  : 0  ] [ZF  : M  ] [SF  : 0  ] [OF  : 0  ] 
       READ: 0x00000000
    WRITTEN: 0x000008D5

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
